{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:48Z","created_by_operation":"op_cb38dc0b2a8640328cc6a61c9cf8003d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_93cb96735cba6cc5868e325c1714aa64e9a1e3fc50d962eb9535c1154a4bdb3e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"tysonlabs/lazyide@7496b58b7782 snapshot f12e7adbb1301325","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_02c6ac768ee4cff172e5b6fd5ce439f67d77e158cce27852c3bf22fc73df12e3","slc_06308b813f2a54b8db293d7153b87212d5367db0f35559f8d296a20fa00a6ebd","slc_88414a47382fa74aa91d58303684c1e7f85a1d71615c854899fea0af8252b499","slc_e6196ef04c043dbd79993ac35706db1d9d8793d2af5cc3a7615be6fd13d47411"],"source_ids":["src_5722485071985d059f4e560943aed56c","src_9d6b58263dc85c3d8d28ea01e3d379a9","src_bd8d8c1fd54e52c18c60ffe852826b08"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors build with cargo (build/run/test), tests are inline `#[cfg(test)]` modules (about 300 tests), and CONTRIBUTING.md asks for an issue before large changes, minimal diffs, and a PR workflow.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:48Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cb38dc0b2a8640328cc6a61c9cf8003d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:48Z","created_by_operation":"op_cb38dc0b2a8640328cc6a61c9cf8003d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c1dd30162aac2892624a2be780d1a6c703c94ff38c3ddbf1730af1a7a94ba2a5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"tysonlabs/lazyide@7496b58b7782 snapshot f12e7adbb1301325","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2df8107e6f62c9e72dec419ed16449e1770d0358ae7c68d6fe99c82b1b523088","slc_88414a47382fa74aa91d58303684c1e7f85a1d71615c854899fea0af8252b499"],"source_ids":["src_bd8d8c1fd54e52c18c60ffe852826b08"],"text":"The product exposes a `--setup` CLI flag that detects and installs optional tools (rust-analyzer, ripgrep), and is run as `lazyide` (or `cargo run -- /path/to/project`) inside a terminal.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:48Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cb38dc0b2a8640328cc6a61c9cf8003d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:48Z","created_by_operation":"op_cb38dc0b2a8640328cc6a61c9cf8003d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d7ef6ef6e84a4172b22e75b24420486d37da5349677f73d5f43fb7dc89796ef8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"tysonlabs/lazyide@7496b58b7782 snapshot f12e7adbb1301325","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2821dbc0c6f6dff4bc0901864b7b9d91336900fa558899e05a1eb14fbbf55715","slc_d764cce431cc7f6365a154d55ba45a7bd5b60243612d81f3362f798a5e3d1f71"],"source_ids":["src_9d6b58263dc85c3d8d28ea01e3d379a9","src_bd8d8c1fd54e52c18c60ffe852826b08"],"text":"Keybindings are data-driven: ~40 actions in a `KeyAction` enum with defaults in `KeyBindings::defaults()`, user overrides loaded from `~/.config/lazyide/keybinds.json`, and a two-pass lookup that first requires exact modifier match then falls back to a Shift-lenient match.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:48Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cb38dc0b2a8640328cc6a61c9cf8003d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:48Z","created_by_operation":"op_cb38dc0b2a8640328cc6a61c9cf8003d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_db15d92c7985ee8ad9593d82e6b532eda70e1a24110b9012d272b23353c825f4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"tysonlabs/lazyide@7496b58b7782 snapshot f12e7adbb1301325","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_32d2e07b2b447bd730929323bae0094f01831cd304cd3a1e3d00e41760ed19f0","slc_8adeba1468638b6ed519c46842ec4ad0f6090555d1ac54c96bf7ada01c91a364"],"source_ids":["src_9d6b58263dc85c3d8d28ea01e3d379a9"],"text":"LSP support is implemented by spawning a rust-analyzer child process over JSON-RPC, with a background stdout reader thread and per-frame polling that matches responses to pending completion/definition requests.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:48Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cb38dc0b2a8640328cc6a61c9cf8003d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:48Z","created_by_operation":"op_cb38dc0b2a8640328cc6a61c9cf8003d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f4e57c4cacd889b20b2c6058efadbf6b1bd6d6746988a679ad742e6c6299bf56","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"tysonlabs/lazyide@7496b58b7782 snapshot f12e7adbb1301325","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1d150cd80146f0e3d00c0ca440ddbd289794a528c1a0f3c39a5c632cc2c4454d"],"source_ids":["src_9d6b58263dc85c3d8d28ea01e3d379a9"],"text":"The main event loop polls LSP responses, a debounced (120ms) file watcher, and autosave (every 2s) each iteration, draws a frame, then waits up to 100ms for terminal key/mouse events.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:48Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cb38dc0b2a8640328cc6a61c9cf8003d"}
